This project was created to teach and inspire young students about:

- Cryptography and information security
- Digital signal processing
- Audio engineering
- Web development with React/TypeScript

The techniques demonstrated here are well-documented in academic literature
and are presented purely for educational enrichment.

If you are a student: Use this to LEARN, not to do anything harmful.
If you are an educator: Feel free to use this as a teaching tool.

"The best way to learn is by building." - Amir Saman Pirayeshfar
